<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>items</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>语音免跳转</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>开启后，点微信键盘的语音键不再“跳一下主程序”：实际录音仍在微信输入法主程序后台完成，但切换动画被隐藏，屏幕上看起来就在当前 App 内直接语音转文字。需在系统设置里给微信键盘开启「完全访问」。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.wxkbd.nojump</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>wxkbdNoJumpEnabled</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>启用免跳转</string>
		</dict>
	</array>
	<key>title</key>
	<string>微信键盘免跳转</string>
</dict>
</plist>
